.TH "stickanimationengine4000-by-faemiyah" "6" "2026-11-18" "Stick Animation Engine 4000 User Manuals" ""
.hy
.SH NAME
.PP
\f[B]stickanimationengine4000-by-faemiyah\f[R] - the command to run
Stick Animation Engine 4000.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.PP
\f[B]stickanimationengine4000-by-faemiyah\f[R]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
\f[B]Stick Animation Engine 4000\f[R] is a 4k intro released by Faemiyah
in august 2008.
Ended 2nd in the 4k intro competition at Assembly 2008.
.PP
Trilkk [Code]
.PP
Juippi [Music, synth]
.PP
The intro opens a resizable 1280x720 window, synthesises its soundtrack
at startup and quits by itself after 91 seconds.
.SH OPTIONS
.PP
This program has no options.
.SH KEYS
.TP
\f[B]F\f[R]
Toggle fullscreen.
.TP
\f[B]Esc\f[R], \f[B]Q\f[R]
Quit.
